{
  "name": "Kanakku text-input eval set v1.1",
  "reference_date": "2026-10-27",
  "notes": "Fictional names and amounts only. 'expected' is what a correct extraction should produce. Where 'expected_flags' is non-empty, the system must ask the user instead of saving. transaction_type is one of: credit_sale, repayment, or null when it cannot be determined. 'seed' = transactions put in the ledger before that case runs.",
